        "Id": "1e433a64-0ed4-4913-8e2c-7932b630f411",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Four Idiots and a Secret",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COASTALTOWN",
        "PublicId": "103737183681",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/_scene_octopus.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 3ed1c7e6-7707-48b4-a0f0-b933bc851fdb).Image",
        "Description": "It started with a burnt risotto. Craig “Rocco” McVeigh stormed off swearing and accidentally overheard his boss&apos;s “retirement plan”—involving poison, politics, and a priest. He told Renardo Palmiero, a bodyguard with more muscles than sense. Renardo bragged to his fishing buddy Sebastiano Noce, who told Ennio Bruno, the flower guy, thinking it was a joke. Now all four know too much. And now... they all gotta go. Clean, quiet, and preferably without setting the villa on fire. Again.",
